# dirs
/.git
npm_modules/

# files
CLAUDE.md
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Runtime working dirs flow writes into the project under management.
# .flow/* (not .flow/) so that !.flow/plans negation can take effect.
# Shared parent directory for git worktrees created by both create-worktree.sh
# (manager-provisioned plan/task worktrees, e.g. plan/<slug>, phase-NN-task-NN-<slug>,
# or YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>) and fsessions' `prep` subcommand (session-level worktrees,
# YYYY-MM-DD-<session-slug>). The two are distinguished only by branch-naming
# pattern, not by directory name.
worktrees/
.flow/*
!.flow/plans
!.flow/project-analysis.json
!.flow/what-next-cache.json

/.mcp.json